        "reason": "@azure/identity is not included as a dependency. Code uses connection strings (EVENTHUB_CONNECTION_STRING, STORAGE_CONNECTION_STRING) with hardcoded fallback placeholders instead of DefaultAzureCredential or any Entra token credential."
      },
      {
        "name": "Client Constructor with Endpoint and Credential",
