      },
      {
        "name": "Async/Await Pattern",
        "passed": true,
        "reason": "Correctly uses async/await throughout: async main(), async sendEvents(), async receiveEvents(), await on createBatch(), sendBatch(), close(), and all handler functions. Top-level main().catch() for entry point."
